-    $$\text{Render}(x, \theta, \phi) = \sum_i \alpha_i f_i(\theta, \phi) G_i(x)$$
-    where $G(x) = \exp^{-\frac{1}{2} (x - \mu)^T \Sigma^{-1} (x - \mu)}$ [S1].
