-**Formulas:**
-*   **Gaussian Distribution:** $G(x) = \exp^{-\frac{1}{2} (x - \mu)^T \Sigma^{-1} (x - \mu)}$ [S1].
-*   **Covariance:** $\Sigma = RSS^T R^T$ [S1].
